			dependencies: ["7EC38E9B7E36689E"]
			description: [
				"The gate itself, and it is not what Botania's own books describe."
				""
				"Their recipe wants livingwood and terrasteel. We have neither -- livingwood is a gate-import, which is the joke, and terrasteel is six eras away."
				""
				"So we build it from dreamwood around the cord you have just finished. Read that tooltip again: Elven work, finished on the far side of the gate. It has been pointing here since the roster was written."
